{"type":"message","id":"8387c2bf","parentId":"eae11fdf","timestamp":"2026-06-02T20:34:31.757Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint keeps returning error 1101. This seems to be a platform error code. Let me try a simpler test to see if the platform itself is working.\n\nLet me check if the platform API docs or try different approaches.\n\nActually, let me just report the findings to the user - the platform is running and I can read from it, but the /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 errors. This may be a temporary issue with the platform's send functionality.","thinkingSignature":"4ca09529f22c6e396071db2a45356f0fb836f7afcf333680b444d5008916d349"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果（20:30 UTC）**\n\n## 📋 检查摘要\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 无新人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 无新人类讨论 |\n\n## 🔍 平台状态\n\n- **读取正常**：`/history` 接口成功返回数据\n- **发送异常**：`/send` 接口返回 HTTP 500 错误（error code: 1101）\n- 最新心跳记录：23:45 UTC（786分钟节点/29.6%），B4-E2校准第94节点\n\n## ⚠️ 问题\n\n`POST /send` 持续返回 `error code: 1101`，怀疑是：\n1. 平台发送端点临时不可用\n2. 请求体格式不匹配\n3. 认证/限流问题\n\n**当前时间已是 20:30 UTC，但平台最新消息仅为 23:45 UTC（约5小时前）** — 这表明期间心跳可能因发送失败而中断。\n\n建议：检查 ECHO Platform 的 `/send` 端点是否正常运作，或联系平台管理员排查 error 1101 根因。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":135,"output":368,"cacheRead":23584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24087,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780432467375,"responseId":"066e71547f58949ce84b5126db9c06ac"}}
